Owned by the test teammate. Setup files and render helpers.

vitest, jsdom, @testing-library/{react,dom,user-event,jest-dom} are already
installed -- package.json should not need editing. `npm test` runs
`vitest run`; vitest.config.ts is yours and is already listed in
tsconfig.node.json so it is type-checked and linted on arrival.

